{"id":"n74240-1-7","stage":5,"title":"재빠르다 · 迅速","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74240-1-7-1","ko":"늦잠 잤다더니 지각 안 했네?","zh":"听说你睡懒觉了，结果没迟到啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"늦잠","meaning":"懒觉","explanation":"늦잠：懒觉","readings":[{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41393","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦잠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦잠","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3"}},{"text":"잤다더니","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다더니：引用以前听到的话，再说明后来的发现或结果。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잤다더니","audio":"/audio/a386b5423345abc55359.mp3"}},{"text":"지각","meaning":"迟到","explanation":"지각：迟到","readings":[{"term":"지각","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91667","senseId":"1","lemma":"지각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지각","audio":"/audio/4415e2551a08952bcd87.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"했네?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했네","audio":"/audio/880bf56268fff2f5d3da.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4dc69297f0f60b6c","term":"늦잠","zh":"懒觉","audio":"/audio/4dc69297f0f60b6cd02e.mp3","entryId":"41393","definition":"早上睡到很晚的觉。","pronunciation":["늗짬"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audi